      "subject": "leta bilong Eliya long Yehoram",
      "rationale": "Yahwe i toktok dairekt long king Yehoram long leta — 'yu' i stap: 'yu no wokabaut'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "Eliya",
      "rationale": "Eliya i bin dai o hara wantaim taim bilong Ahazia, planti man i ting Eliya i go hara bipo; leta i kam bihain — ol man i aguman: leta i kam bifo o bihain long hara bilong Eliya."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na wanpela leta i kam long em, long profet Eliya, we i tok: Olsem Yahwe, Elohim bilong David, papa bilong yu, i tok — bilong wanem yu no wokabaut long ol roa bilong Yehoshafat, papa bilong yu, na long ol roa bilong Asa, king bilong Yehuda —",
